  "title": "The AI That Helps You With Whatever's on Your Screen (2026)",
  "summary": "We have all been stuck: a menu we cannot find, a setting buried three panels deep, an app we have never used before. A new kind of assistant changes that. It can see your screen, understand what you are looking at, and talk you through it out loud. Here is how screen-aware voice assistants work, and how to get one today with VoiceOS.",
